@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title WF-2: Detection Engine Flow (v3.3 - Risk Gate + Direct HTTP)

participant "Core App" as CA #DAE8FC
database "core-db" as CDB #F5F5F5
participant "Outbox\nPoller\n(NOT impl.)" as OP #F5F5F5
participant "Detection Engine\n(port 8001)" as DE #FFF2CC
database "detection-db" as DDB #F5F5F5
participant "ML Service\n(port 8002)" as ML #E1D5E7
database "ml-service-db" as MDB #F5F5F5

== Phase 0: Risk Gate (đồng bộ, 2026-10-05) ==

note over CA, DE
  Sau khi xác thực mật khẩu thành công,
  TRƯỚC khi tạo session / cấp token.
  FAIL OPEN: lỗi hoặc timeout thì vẫn cho đăng nhập.
end note

CA -> DE : **POST /api/v1/internal/pre-token-check**\n(username, user_id, ip, ua)\n+ Internal-Secret, timeout 3s
activate DE
DE --> CA : {risk_level, decision,\nrequire_mfa, degraded}
deactivate DE

alt require_mfa = true (high / critical)
    CA -> CA : detection_mfa_once = true
    note right: **Chưa tạo session,\nchưa cấp token**
    CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempts\n(outcome=mfa_required)
    CA -> CDB : INSERT mfa_transactions
    CA --> CA : 200 {mfa_required: true}\n(xử lý ở WF-4)
else low / medium / degraded
    CA --> CA : tiếp tục tạo session
end

== Phase 1: Login Event (gửi trực tiếp) ==

note over CA, CDB
  Core App INSERT login_attempts rồi POST thẳng
  sang Detection. KHÔNG qua outbox_events:
  bảng có trong schema nhưng code chưa ghi,
  và chưa có poller (DECISIONS mục 12).
end note

CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempts\n(user_id, ip_address, user_agent,\noutcome, timestamp)
activate CDB
deactivate CDB

== Phase 2: HTTP Push to Detection Engine ==

CA -> DE : **POST /api/v1/internal/login-events**\n(event_id, user_id, username_attempted,\noutcome, ip, ua, timestamp)\n+ Internal-Secret header
activate DE

DE -> DE : Validate Internal-Secret
DE -> DE : Check event_id idempotency

alt event ALREADY PROCESSED
    DE --> CA : **200 OK** {deduplicated: true}
    deactivate DE
else NEW event
    DE -> DDB : INSERT login_attempts\n(event_id, user_id, outcome, ip, ua,\ntimestamp, status=pending)
    activate DDB
    deactivate DDB
    DE --> CA : **202 Accepted** {login_attempt_id}
    deactivate DE
end

== Phase 3: Detection Pipeline (đồng bộ trong handler) ==

note over DE, DDB
  process_attempt() được await ngay trong request
  handler. KHÔNG có worker nền poll pending.
end note

loop ngay trong handler (không có worker nền)
    DE -> DE : Load active policy
    DE -> DE : Calculate rule_score\n(IP new? fail_count? new_device?\nunusual_hour? new_country? VPN/Tor?)
    DE -> DDB : INSERT detection_logs\n(stage=rule_evaluation,\nrule_name, triggered, score_contribution)

    == ML Scoring (Xem WF-6 chi tiết) ==
    DE -> ML : **POST /api/v1/internal/ml/score**\n(request_id, features: {6 features})\n+ Internal-Secret, timeout 5s
    activate ML
    ML --> DE : {normalized_anomaly_score, is_anomaly,\nreason_codes, model_version, model_status}
    deactivate ML

    == Combine Scores ==
    DE -> DE : rule_score = min(1.0, SUM(score*weight) / SUM(weight cua rule da bat))
    DE -> DE : combined_score =\n0.4 x rule_score + 0.6 x ml_score\n(neu ML that: combined = rule_score)
    DE -> DE : risk_level =\nlow < 0.25 <= medium < 0.50 <= high < 0.75 <= critical

    DE -> DDB : INSERT risk_assessments\n(login_attempt_id, policy_id, rule_score, ml_score,\ncombined_score, ml_status, ml_model_version,\nrule_hits, ml_reason_codes, ml_features_used,\nrisk_level, decision)

    == Action Decision ==
    alt risk_level IN (high, critical)
        DE -> DDB : INSERT alerts\n(login_attempt_id, status=open,\nrisk_level, detection_reason,\ndetection_scores)
        DE -> DDB : INSERT detection_logs\n(stage=action_sent, stage_detail=alert_created)
    else risk_level IN (low, medium)
        DE -> DDB : INSERT detection_logs\n(stage=action_sent, stage_detail=no_alert)
    end

    == Gửi hành động về Core (SAU khi commit) ==
    note over DE, CA
      timeout 3s, nuốt lỗi, có idempotency_key.
      critical KHÔNG gửi LOCK_USER.
    end note
    alt risk_level = high
        DE -> CA : **POST /api/v1/internal/actions**\n(action=REQUIRE_MFA, target_user_id,\nreason, alert_id, severity=high,\nidempotency_key)\n+ Internal-Secret
        activate CA
        CA -> CDB : UPDATE users\nSET detection_mfa_once=true
        CA -> CDB : UPDATE sessions\nSET revoked_at=NOW()\n(phiên đang hoạt động)
        CA --> DE : **200 OK**\n{details.sessions_revoked}
        deactivate CA
    else risk_level = critical
        DE -> CA : **POST /api/v1/internal/actions**\n(action=REVOKE_SESSIONS,\ntarget_user_id, reason, alert_id,\nseverity=critical, idempotency_key)\n+ Internal-Secret
        activate CA
        CA -> CDB : UPDATE sessions\nSET revoked_at=NOW()\n(phiên đang hoạt động)
        CA --> DE : **200 OK**\n{details.sessions_revoked}
        deactivate CA
    end
end

note over DE
  **v3.3 Key Points:**
  - HIGH/CRITICAL: token bị giữ, bắt MFA trước khi cấp
  - Cổng risk gate FAIL OPEN khi Detection lỗi
  - Detection tự gọi /actions sau khi commit verdict
  - REQUIRE_MFA cũng thu hồi phiên đang hoạt động
  - Outbox pattern: THIẾT KẾ ĐÍCH, chưa hiện thực
  - Xem DECISIONS-DETECTION-v3.3.md mục 10, 11, 12
end note

@enduml
